ARTICLE XIX
MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS
SECTION 1. Parliamentary Authority, Rules of the National Assembly.
Article VIII, Rules of the National Assembly of this Philippine Eagles Constitution, shall be the primary parliamentary authority governing the meetings of the Philippine Eagles, Eagles Region, Eagles Club and other bodies in the Philippine Eagles.
SECTION 2. Supplementary Authority. In so far as they are not inconsistent with Article VIII of this Philippine Eagles Constitution, the following shall have supplementary force and effect;
a. Parliamentary Practices and Precedents of the National Assembly of the Philippine Eagles since 1989;
b. Parliamentary Rules, Practices and Precedents of the Congress of the Republic of the Philippines Rules;
c. Rules of the House of Representatives, Commented and Annotated, Copyright 1963, or as revised, if any, by Inocencio Pereja; and
d. Annotated Rules of the Senate: Procedures, Precedents and Practices of the Senate of the Philippines since 1946, by Honorata M. Orquiola, published in 1991.
